This directory contains ciphertext only.

WireGuard host bundles live at wireguard/hosts/<immutable-node-id>.sops.yaml.
Each bundle contains that node's private key, only the PSK copies required by topology.requiredLinks, and the byte-exact base64-encoded canonical K3s server token when the node has a K3s role. Agent imports never trust a local agent token; populate them with `copy-k3s-token` from an existing server.
Every bundle must be encrypted to the target host age recipient and the offline operator recovery recipient. Plaintext workspaces exist only on local tmpfs. `stage-secrets` decodes the token to `/run/homelab-secrets/active/k3s/server-token` and removes a partial remote generation on failure; the token never enters the Nix store.
Placeholder recipients in topology are an intentional hard gate: replace them before importing any secret.

Kubernetes bootstrap credentials live at kubernetes/<cluster>-bootstrap.sops.yaml.
Never commit plaintext, generated QR/PNG files, age identities, decrypted generations, or migration receipts.
